          "en": "Last time, Narasimha burst out of a pillar, and the boy Prahlada became king."
        },
        {
          "es": "Muchos años después, su nieto Bali era el rey de los asuras, los rivales de los dioses.",
          "en": "Many years later, his grandson Bali was king of the asuras, the rivals of the gods."
        },
