          "es": "Su nombre era Vamana, que quiere decir \"el enano\".",
          "en": "His name was Vamana, which means \"the dwarf\"."
        },
        {
          "es": "Llevaba una sombrilla pequeña y una vasija de agua.",
          "en": "He carried a little umbrella and a water pot."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y caminó hacia el gran sacrificio que celebraba el rey Bali.",
          "en": "And he walked to the great sacrifice that King Bali was holding."
