      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pero Shukra, el maestro de Bali, vio quién era de verdad el niño.",
          "en": "But Shukra, Bali's teacher, saw who the boy really was."
        },
        {
          "es": "\"¡Es Vishnu!\", le advirtió. \"Con dos pasos te va a quitar todo lo que tienes\".",
          "en": "\"That is Vishnu!\" he warned. \"With two steps, he will take everything you have.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Bali lo pensó un momento. \"Ya di mi palabra\", dijo. \"No la voy a romper\".",
          "en": "Bali thought for a moment. \"I have given my word,\" he said. \"I will not break it.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Shukra se enojó tanto que lo maldijo. Pero Bali no cambió de idea.",
          "en": "Shukra was so angry that he cursed him. But Bali did not change his mind."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y vertió agua en la mano del niño, para sellar el regalo.",
          "en": "Then he poured water into the boy's hand, to seal the gift."
        }
      ],
