          "en": "He sent him to rule Sutala, a beautiful world under the earth, richer than heaven itself."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y le prometió protegerlo, y estar siempre cerca de su puerta, con la maza en la mano.",
          "en": "And he promised to protect him, and to stay near his door forever, mace in hand."
