      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En Kerala, en el sur de la India, esta historia se vive de una forma especial.",
          "en": "In Kerala, in the south of India, this story is lived in a special way."
        },
        {
          "es": "No está en el Purana, es una tradición de Kerala: una vez al año, Bali vuelve a visitar a su gente.",
          "en": "It is not in the Purana, but a Kerala tradition: once a year, Bali comes back to visit his people."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esa fiesta se llama Onam. Las familias hacen alfombras de flores y grandes banquetes para recibirlo.",
          "en": "That festival is called Onam. Families make carpets of flowers and big feasts to welcome him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus canciones dicen que, en tiempos de Bali, todos eran iguales y felices.",
          "en": "Their songs say that in Bali's time, everyone was equal and happy."
        }
